window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Curiosity. It’s going to get more than just the cat killed. Sacramento has its share of spooky, crazy, and unexplained, just like everywhere else, but most other places don’t have a self-appointed paranormal investigator to really stir things up.</p> <p>There are good reasons to fear the night. August Watson is about to kick them in the pants.</p> <p>With an oversized sidekick, a school-skipping apprentice, and too many bad habits to count, August aims to drag the truth into the light. Kicking and screaming if necessary.</p>"; 
